Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1044-1046] Onigashima 45 - Warrior of Liberation.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Joyboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:36.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.45,0:00:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How come I can still stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might've lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but now it's gettin' fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Joyboy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:00:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does he mean Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that what Zunesha said?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1613,320)}Pleasure Hall\NLeft-Brain Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've come to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Gentleman Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:17.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.07,0:01:21.08,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1620,295)}Performance\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that the Straw Hat Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's still kickin' yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's not dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro's still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.59,0:01:41.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1749,383)}Holy Land\NMary Geoise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:43.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1714,597)}Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.97,0:01:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sacrificing one of our best agents...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.94,0:01:49.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1650,1000)}Hall of Authority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:52.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(961,135)}...simply to enrage Kaido\Nis like putting the cart before the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suppose there was some possible future where\Nwe would beg for this outcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:02:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eliminating dangerous variables\Nis always best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since its inception,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.91,0:02:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the World Government has sought after\Nthe Gum-Gum Fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:16.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, not once has it come\Ninto our possession...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even once,\Nin eight hundred years!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.51,0:02:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:26.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the Devil Fruit evades us, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not entirely implausible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoan-type Devil Fruits\Nhave wills of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, that Devil Fruit\Nbears the name of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Gum-Gum Fruit\Ngoes by another name...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Zoan-type, Human-Human Fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mythical Type, Model:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:03:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say his body takes on\Nthe very properties of rubber itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He fights as he fancies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and brings smiles to\Nthe faces of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Warrior of Liberation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Nika, the Sun God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awakening the power is said to bestow upon\Nthe user's body even greater physical strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is said that in all the world,\Nthere is no power more...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi-Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:04:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You know,\NI really did like Oden, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think about it, won't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was exploited by Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's run away from this,\Nyou and I!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:16.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just remove this nail from me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pray tell who would lend\Nyou their ear now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My father...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:31.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kept his word to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,did he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He believed that you and Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:38.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...would set free the Land of Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and so he spent five years...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...making a complete fool of himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And not once did he\Ncomplain of it to his family!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My father kept his word!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He took you at your word:\Nyou would set his people free...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so he withstood\Nan hour of torture by boiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His body, cooked alive\Nby the scorching oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forever and ever,\Nalways bearing a smile upon his face...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, the nation whole\Nwas taken hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:26.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he alone its burden bore...\No, Father, how you suffered so!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How hellish it must have been!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is the matter, Hiyori?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father, are you fine with\Npeople speaking ill of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye, 'tis just as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:52.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I have all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?\NThen, I'll always be with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weeell... Oden was a\Nmost impressive samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deserving of praise, even!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As Shogun, I would be pleased\Nto reward your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kozuki Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will hold your tongue,\Ninsolent knave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even as I starved and\Nwore little more than tatters...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I strove to live up\Nto my father's name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:42.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was never a single day\Nwhen you were the true Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are as foolish\Nas you are uncouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the more you act as such,\Nthe more lives will have been shattered in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Now, now! No closer!\NDon't do anything rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vengeance-seeking is\Nquite antiquated, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you kill me,\Nyou can't defeat Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:09.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You!\NIs that you, Kanjuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is... as far as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I grant you a new stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn that woman to ash!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The failure of a woman\Nthat endured hardship for twenty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a tragicomedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vestige of the Kozuki, Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This... This is the luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...of the strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:08:00.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:05.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not toward me!\NDon't come toward me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:11.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro, you damned fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiyori!\NSave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oww hothothot owhotow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Dawn... will surely come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our clan, the Kozuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...always keeps their word!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can do everything\NI've ever wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:43.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I think I can get\Na little more fightin' in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, my heartbeat sounds funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:58.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've hit my peak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:03.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:04.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:16.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone's Color of the Conquerors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's it coming from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, the bunch of ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that on the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:48.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Musclin', musclin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Upsy-daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're alive, huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hwuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get 'im!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:12:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel bad about what\Nthat moron did earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to win like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dun worry 'bout it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:16.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's settle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:40.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how the rubber power's\Naffecting other things...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:54.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's probably safe to say\Nyour Paramythia's awakened, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But something\Nabout it's a little off...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That kind of\Nfull-body transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is something you\Nonly see with Zoans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So dark! So cramped!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya big jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muscly muscles...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:54.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:15:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a shootin' star!\NJust call me Shooting Luffytaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:05.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enjoy, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stahgp mehssgin'\N'roundg ing ere...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:31.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't the slightest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido became quite rotund!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did he have a form like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what's going on with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:53.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My body ain't made of rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's a riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a couple of lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fun's just gettin' started!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Escape Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:13.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Gigant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do I hear Luffy's voice\Nfrom up there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hueh?!\NIs that Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jump Rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:18.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.59,0:18:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eeeyowww!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now ya've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Conqueror of Three Worlds:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Ragnaraku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hoiiits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:12.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohmygaaaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaaaaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell does\NStraw Hat look like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like something\Nright out of a comic strip...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ooh, yow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very entertaining show you put on.\NBut, you've hit the wall, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't got what it takes\Nto knock me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shuddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shuddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who says I've hit the wall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.09,0:20:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was dyin' 'fore this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:46.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, this really\Neats up my energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:48.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, you'll die knowing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that someone'll pass down the story\Nof how the bunch of you fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dun...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...need...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:20:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...any of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we die,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all that's left of us is bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He truly is Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.89,0:21:16.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did not appear to be himself,\Nowing to his hair and clothes turning white...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,his voice is fading away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:24.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This can't end...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.53,0:21:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't end just yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful,\Nor you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.22,0:21:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya actually think\NI'm afraid o' that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.57,0:22:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon heart, hit that beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have it your way, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.51,0:22:36.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's the sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look out, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:22:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yowwieee!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:34.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just what could it all mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.99,0:23:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turning white all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:39.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,coating himself in both\NArmament and Conqueror Haki,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.45,0:23:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,affecting things other than himself with his powers,\Nand fighting so fast and loose...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.38,0:23:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right this way!\NC'mon, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.76,0:23:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a pretty neat attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Rightbackatcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.24,0:24:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Playing games with kids is seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.54,0:24:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.13,0:24:32.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's fun, don'cha think,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.09,0:25:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's pretty powerful too!\NAnd I get a kick outta it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't make up my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.89,0:25:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do I call this attack?\N"Gum-Gum" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.03,0:25:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...\NGum Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.40,0:25:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.12,0:25:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.80,0:25:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How long has it been...!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This rhythm!\NJoyboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.14,0:26:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, Joyboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.43,0:26:06.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is as if you are actually here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How my heart dances!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.73,0:26:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I sense this must be fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.78,0:26:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot help but place my faith in him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who am I, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man that's gonna best ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.95,0:26:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and become the Pirate King!
